cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Anamnesis in your work, please cite it.
title: "Anamnesis: a local-first calibration ledger for forecasts and agents"
abstract: >-
  A command-line tool that records a falsifiable belief with a probability or a
  credible interval before the outcome is known, then scores the forecast made
  first rather than the one revised afterwards. Reports the CORP decomposition of
  the Brier score against its own noise floor, an anytime-valid calibration
  e-process valid under repeated inspection, and a stake-aware decision gate.
  Runs offline with no model in the scoring path.
type: software
authors:
